# Project Architecture

```
                User
                  │
                  ▼
           bin/stoleus
                  │
                  ▼
            CLI Commands
                  │
                  ▼
          Pipeline Engine
                  │
      ┌───────────┼───────────┐
      ▼           ▼           ▼
   Chrony     Firewall     Docker
                  │
                  ▼
            Linux Services
                  │
                  ▼
             Linux Kernel
```

---

# Repository Structure

```text
bin/
    CLI entry point

commands/
    Command routing

lib/
    Shared libraries

lib/components/
    Infrastructure components

docs/
    Project documentation

.github/
    GitHub workflows and templates
```

---

# Design Principles

Stoleus is built around several core engineering principles.

## Idempotency

Running the same command multiple times should always produce the same result.

---

## Fail Fast

Errors should be detected immediately and stop execution before the system enters an inconsistent state.

---

## Modular Design

Each infrastructure component lives in its own module.

Example:

```text
chrony.sh
firewall.sh
docker.sh
directories.sh
```

---

## Separation of Concerns

```
CLI

↓

Command Routing

↓

Libraries

↓

Infrastructure Components
```

Every layer has a single responsibility.

---

## Verification First

Configuration is never considered complete until it has been verified.

Example:

```
Install

↓

Configure

↓

Verify

↓

Success
```

---

